OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed after bus crashes into
OL,4,Apub                                    
OL,6,FA road has been closed after a coach   
OL,7,Fcrashed into a pub in a town in        
OL,8,FDerbyshire.                            
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said it was on the   
OL,11,Fscene of a crash in Butterley Hill,    
OL,12,FRipley, where a bus had struck The     
OL,13,FTalbot Taphouse.                       
OL,15,FThe collision has sent rubble and      
OL,16,Fdebris from the building into the road 
OL,17,Fand caused extensive damage to the     
OL,18,Ffront of the coach. Officers said there
OL,19,Fwere no reports of serious injuries.   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
